<title>UK: SOCCER-COPPELL QUITS AT MANCHESTER CITY AFTER A MONTH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPPELL QUITS AT MANCHESTER CITY AFTER A MONTH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester City manager Steve Coppell resigned on Friday following medical advice due to &quot;huge pressures.&quot;</p>
<p>His departure from the English first division club was announced at a news conference.</p>
<p>Coppell, formerly with Crystal Palace, has only been in the job at Maine Road for a month.</p>
